Error [E0209]: Implicit clone of `x`
  --> tests/ui/implicit_take_keeps_mark.jet:19:10
    |
 19 |     sink(x)
    |          ^
 Why: `sink` expects to take ownership of this value
 Fix: Write the move marker `^` (`^x`) to move it — this is `x`'s last use — or `x.copy()` to keep a copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0209

